<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Islam Malaysia year net down 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank Islam Malaysia year net down 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  31.30   vs	  34.74</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 23.5    vs	  26.0</p>
<p>    Operating income	 154.09   vs	 136.84</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    56.84   vs	  59.16</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less   1.97   vs   less  0.34</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   10.45   vs   less  3.19</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)     9.00   vs	   9.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Bank Islam Malaysia Bhd is engaged in commercial Islamic banking and stockbroking.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
